  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0dlliqm.png\" width=\"1903\" height=\"1070\" /></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/HZFXtcG2Ty\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/804423500580388905?label=&amp;color=7096aa&amp;labelColor=55778c&amp;logo=Discord&amp;logoColor=7096aa&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/uraneptus2\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/uraneptus2?label=&amp;color=7096aa&amp;labelColor=55778c&amp;logo=Twitter&amp;logoColor=7096aa&amp;style=for-the-badge\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/410500.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" /></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/410500.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" /></a></p>\n\n[![ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg)](https://ko-fi.com/V7V5SJI0W)\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\" /></span></p>\n<h2>📖關於：</h2>\n<h4>此模組為《Minecraft》增添了冰凍豬。這種豬與普通豬非常相似，會掉落冰凍豬肉排，可解凍為普通豬肉排。</h4>\n<h4>火焰附魔也能解凍冰凍豬肉排。</h4>\n<h4>你可以在所有歸類為「ICY」的生物群落中找到牠。</h4>\n<h4>當雪豬被流浪者殺死時，會掉落一張自訂音樂唱片，收錄由&nbsp;<span class=\"username-2b1r56 username-FvTBog\">Luz</span><span class=\"discriminator-1swucG\">#8017</span> 創作的歌曲。</h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4>你也可以在此收聽這首歌曲：<br /><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vDBh9JsE0Hw\">YouTube</a>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/luuuzzdj/luz-frosty-snig-snow-pig-soundtrack\">Soundcloud</a></h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"customStatusActivity-nmH3DF\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>注意：&nbsp;本模組的 1.12.2 與 1.15.2 版本已不再提供支援！若有人希望將此模組移植至舊版，請透過 Discord：&nbsp;Uraneptus#5442 或 Twitter 聯繫我。</h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;你可以在這裡找到 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snow-pig-fabric\">這裡！</a></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\" /></p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤回報：</h2>\n<h4>若你能透過 Issues 頁面回報錯誤，將對我有很大幫助！</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\" /></p>\n<h2>🎲 選用模組相容性：</h2>\n<h4>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\">Farmer's Delight</a></h4>\n<h4>-&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/catalogue\">Catalogue</a></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\" /></p>\n<h2>🚀 未來規劃：</h2>\n<h4>- 移植至未來版本&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>【若有功能建議，歡迎在留言區或 Issues 頁面告訴我！】</h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/W5LN551.png\" width=\"1188\" height=\"19\" /></span></p>\n\n[![ko-fi](https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg)](https://ko-fi.com/V7V5SJI0W)",
